{"id": "225325", "name": "שונות של X+Y – התפלגות אחידה על משולש", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> משתנה מקרי דו-מימדי רציף המתפלג אחיד על התחום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[D = \\left\\{(x,y) \\in \\mathbb{R}^2 \\ : \\ x \\geq 0 \\ , \\ y \\geq 0 \\ , \\ x+y \\leq {{CT:0}} \\right\\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[X+Y]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מוצאים את ההתפלגות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S=X+Y\\)</span> מיחס שטחים, ואז מחשבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}[S]=\\mathbb{E}[S^2]-\\left(\\mathbb{E}[S]\\right)^2\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההתפלגות של X+Y</b><br>שטח המשולש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(D\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{ {{CT:0}}^2}{2}\\)</span>. לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\le s\\le {{CT:0}}\\)</span> המאורע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S\\le s\\)</span> הוא המשולש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{x,y\\ge0,\\ x+y\\le s\\}\\)</span> ששטחו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{s^2}{2}\\)</span>, ובהתפלגות אחידה ההסתברות היא יחס השטחים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F_S(s)=\\frac{s^2/2}{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:2}},\\qquad f_S(s)=F_S'(s)={{CT:3}},\\qquad 0\\le s\\le {{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המומנטים</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[S]=\\int_0^{ {{CT:0}} } s\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\,ds={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\mathbb{E}[S^2]=\\int_0^{ {{CT:0}} } s^2\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\,ds={{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השונות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Var}[X+Y]=\\mathbb{E}[S^2]-\\left(\\mathbb{E}[S]\\right)^2={{CT:1}}-\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)^2={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["r", "ta"], "nvariants": 10}